128
00:08:16,110 --> 00:08:20,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yajirobe's telling the truth...</font>

129
00:08:20,050 --> 00:08:22,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That you would be beaten up, Goku-<i>san</i>...</font>

130
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:24,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So there's someone that powerful?</font>

131
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:30,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's why I came here, I thought
