132
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:33,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you're going back up Karin Tower?!</font>

133
00:08:35,460 --> 00:08:37,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm going up.</font>

134
00:08:53,810 --> 00:08:57,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But you don't stand a
