135
00:08:57,480 --> 00:09:00,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Rest here for two or three days.
- I'm fine.</font>

136
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:03,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yajirobe's going to take me up there.</font>

137
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:05,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What did you say?!</font>

138
00:09:05,290 --> 00:09:07,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You should be able to
