139
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:09,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You idiot!</font>

140
00:09:09,330 --> 00:09:10,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This isn't the time for jokes!</font>

141
00:09:10,860 --> 00:09:12,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why me?!</font>

142
00:09:12,130 --> 00:09:15,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! You can't trust this guy!</font>

143
00:09:15,300 --> 00:09:17,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You shut your trap!</font>

144
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:31,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Anyway, you can count me out. I'm splittin'.</font>

145
00:09:31,180 --> 00:09:35,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't wanna get involved
