148
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We don't want you here anyway!</font>

149
00:09:48,970 --> 00:09:51,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So long.</font>

150
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:55,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yajirobe, the food's at
