151
00:09:55,970 --> 00:09:58,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're such a liar.</font>

152
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm not lying!</font>

153
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:06,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I only had a little bit before,
