154
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:08,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What kind of food is it?</font>

155
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:10,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's called "senzu."</font>

156
00:10:10,990 --> 00:10:14,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Senzu? That's a weird name...</font>

157
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:17,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's wizard food.</font>

158
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:19,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wizard... food?</font>

159
00:10:29,170 --> 00:10:31,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hold on tight!</font>

160
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:33,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you fall off, you're on your own!</font>

161
00:10:33,110 --> 00:10:35,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thanks for helping...</font>

